      "message": "I think this function may be called via TPM2.0 \u0027manufacture()\u0027 or one time setup type function. In addition I can see it being called once an unrecoverable error case is detected. I will fixed the description in nvmem.h. I thought I had updated it, but may have lost it when I pulled it in from my dev branch.",
